Backport of libffi PR #857 for the pinned 3.4.2 source:
https://github.com/libffi/libffi/pull/857
Upstream merge: 8308bed5b2423878aa20d7884a99cf2e30b8daf7

On Mach-O, a non-private symbol must not occur inside a CFI procedure.
Start CFI after the function label, as in the upstream fix. This avoids
invalid CFI advance_loc expressions with newer Apple Clang assemblers.

--- a/src/aarch64/sysv.S
+++ b/src/aarch64/sysv.S
@@ -79,2 +79,2 @@
-	cfi_startproc
-CNAME(ffi_call_SYSV):
+CNAME(ffi_call_SYSV):
+	cfi_startproc
@@ -271,2 +271,2 @@
-	cfi_startproc
-CNAME(ffi_closure_SYSV):
+CNAME(ffi_closure_SYSV):
+	cfi_startproc
@@ -503,2 +503,2 @@
-	cfi_startproc
-CNAME(ffi_go_closure_SYSV):
+CNAME(ffi_go_closure_SYSV):
+	cfi_startproc
